WEBVTT

00:00:02.440 --> 00:00:04.267
Start with a document: a fictional services agreement.

00:00:04.267 --> 00:00:06.103
Clai reads it in the browser: 2 pages, 23 passages.

00:00:06.103 --> 00:00:08.697
Ask in plain language.

00:00:08.697 --> 00:00:12.144
The answer quotes the clause that settles it: 8.1, page 2.

00:00:12.144 --> 00:00:15.366
One click shows it highlighted in the original document.

00:00:15.366 --> 00:00:18.819
Follow-ups keep their context.

00:00:18.819 --> 00:00:23.662
Clause 8.2: termination for cause.

00:00:23.662 --> 00:00:27.142
If the agreement doesn't say, Clai says so.
